cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "SLQ: Statistically-Lossless Quantization of Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of SLQ: layer-wise non-uniform asymmetric
  quantization with multi-bitwidth Shapley sensitivity estimation and
  ILP-based bitwidth allocation, targeting task-lossless and
  distribution-lossless (EAR) fidelity.
